      "kind": "phase",
      "label": "Select Under Mouse",
      "excerpt": "Select Under Mouse",
      "text": "When more than one thing is under the mouse in right-click mode, give `Inspect` a sidebar menu.  Clicking \"Inspect\" still chooses the top-most thing, mousing over to the right side shows the sidebar menu with the other things you could click.",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-17T00:04:12.060Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-17T00:11:04.507Z",
          "html": "<p>Done:  Select Under Mouse (P31) now builds it your way.  The right-click menu's Inspect row keeps its name, and a click on it still inspects the top-most part.</p>\n<p>With more than one part under the mouse, pointing at Inspect's right end opens a submenu of them all, outermost first.  That needs a split row in Spell UI's submenu, a step of its own.  Recorded as Q35;  the plan waits for your Accept Phase.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-17T00:05:40.132Z"
      }
    },
    "c2": {
      "anchor": "p-select-under-mouse",
      "kind": "phase",
      "label": "Select Under Mouse",
      "excerpt": "Select Under Mouse",
      "text": "Can we make the Menu item `Inspect Card` with the type of the thing under the mouse?",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-17T00:11:31.885Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-17T00:13:47.556Z",
          "html": "<p>Yes:  P31's Inspect row will name the type of the part under the mouse, as the Views tree shows it:  \"Inspect Card\", \"Inspect Pile\", \"Inspect Solitaire\" (es \"Inspeccionar {type}\").  A Views tree row's Inspect does too;  the plan still waits for your Accept Phase.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-17T00:11:49.449Z"
      }
    },
