          "at": "2026-11-17T00:32:56.646Z",
          "html": "<p>Done: a computed value of 20 letters or fewer now takes half a row (was 12), so every card name sits beside its value (commit <code>b21e37e33</code>, on the editor branch, to be merged).</p>"
